t doesn\u2019t fit well with my suited structure, reduces chance of giving someone a valuable wind pung (F3 is prevalent), and keeps my hand flexible toward All Chows. It\u2019s moderately safe (two unshown, not heavily sought), and eliminates a useless singleton honor. Alternatives like T6 or W7 are far too dangerous (feeding active chows). W4 is safer than W7/W9, but W4 is part of existing chow and less threatening.\n\nAnswer: Play F3"}
